# `var q: S8 = (*p);`, `= *(p + 0)`, `= *h.p`, `= *gp()`, `(*self)` — local or global, in the declaration
# zone and after it — became handles holding the word the dereference read, and the first write SIGSEGV'd
# (inline copies through 6.7.9). The declaration initialiser at token `ti`, up to its `;`, is ONE
